<title>USA: U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. orange juice stocks in cold storage - USDA.</headline>
<text>
<p>WASHINGTON, Jan 21 (Reuter) USDA report of frozen concentrated orange juice stocks in cold storage, in 1,000s of units:</p>
<p>    -	 12/31/96   11/30/96---Rev from    12/31/95</p>
<p> Gallons     108,119     69,824     67,972     106,164</p>
<p> Lbs	 1,069,945    690,976    672,647   1,050,596</p>
<p>Note-FCOJ stocks are based on 42.0 degrees Brix equivalent of 9.896 lbs per gallon.</p>
</text>
